<concept xml:lang="en-us" id="d2e27">
   <title>Respirable Crystalline Silica</title>
   <conbody>
      <p>
         <b>Crystalline silica has been classified as a human lung carcinogen.</b> Breathing
         crystalline silica dust can cause silicosis, which in severe cases can be disabling, or
         even fatal.</p>
